Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: include_list using_statement function_list

    2 include_list: ε
    3             | include_file include_list

    4 using_statement: ε
    5                | USING_NAMESPACE

    6 include_file: INCLUDE SMALLER_THAN IDENTIFIER GREATER_THAN

    7 function_definition: TYPE IDENTIFIER L_PAR parameter_list R_PAR statement_block

    8 function_list: function_definition
    9              | function_definition function_list

   10 parameter: TYPE IDENTIFIER

   11 parameter_list: ε
   12               | non_empty_parameter_list

   13 non_empty_parameter_list: parameter
   14                         | parameter COMMA non_empty_parameter_list

   15 statement_block: L_BRACE statement_list R_BRACE

   16 statement_list: ε
   17               | statement statement_list

   18 statement: variable_declaration SEMI_COLON
   19          | expression_statement SEMI_COLON
   20          | return_statement SEMI_COLON
   21          | if_statement
   22          | while_statement
   23          | read_statement SEMI_COLON
   24          | print_statement SEMI_COLON

   25 variable_declaration: TYPE IDENTIFIER variable_value_assignation variable_declaration_enumeration

   26 variable_value_assignation: ε
   27                           | EQUAL arithmetic_expression

   28 variable_declaration_enumeration: ε
   29                                 | COMMA IDENTIFIER variable_value_assignation variable_declaration_enumeration

   30 expression_statement: ε
   31                     | expression

   32 return_statement: RETURN expression_statement

   33 else_if_statement: ε
   34                  | ELSE statement_block

   35 if_statement: IF L_PAR boolean_expression R_PAR statement_block else_if_statement

   36 while_statement: WHILE L_PAR boolean_expression R_PAR statement_block

   37 read_statement: READ SHIFT_RIGHT IDENTIFIER

   38 print_statement: WRITE SHIFT_LEFT IDENTIFIER

   39 expression: term
   40           | expression OPERATOR term
   41           | expression BOOL_OPERATOR term

   42 arithmetic_expression: term operator_usage

   43 boolean_expression: term boolean_operator_usage

   44 operator_usage: ε
   45               | OPERATOR term operator_usage

   46 boolean_operator_usage: ε
   47                       | BOOL_OPERATOR term boolean_operator_usage

   48 term: IDENTIFIER
   49     | NUMBER
   50     | BOOLEAN_LITERAL


